    <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncomms5936> dct:title "The transcription factor Apontic-like controls diverse colouration pattern in caterpillars" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012> dct:title "The chemical basis of morphogenesis" .
